  Freedom Tech Park track in Fort Walton Beach. Walkers go around the trac
 k in glow-in-the-dark clothing for about 100 minutes\, with live music an
 d games on the flyer. The event raises money and awareness for children a
 nd adults with intellectual and developmental disabilities.\nPrice: from 
